<div class="top"><div><h1 class="px">Moon Base Trade-Offs</h1>
<p id="sub">Run a moon outpost for 12 days. Every choice costs something else.</p></div><button id="help" aria-label="Open the how to play tutorial">? HOW TO PLAY</button></div>
